BT /F2 18 Tf 72 740 Td (Club Statutes) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 16 TL 72 700 Td
(The MC Club is a non-profit association open to all students.) Tj T*
(Its purpose is to organise cultural, scientific and sports activities.) Tj T*
(Membership is granted after paying the annual fee of fifty dinars.) Tj T*
(Members elect a board of seven people every two years.) Tj T*
(The board meets on the first Monday of each month at six in the evening.) Tj T*
(Decisions are taken by simple majority of the members present.) Tj T*
ET
