BT /F2 18 Tf 72 740 Td (Elections) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 16 TL 72 700 Td
(Board elections take place in May during the general assembly.) Tj T*
(Candidates must register with the secretary at least one week ahead.) Tj T*
(Each member has one vote and proxy voting is limited to one proxy.) Tj T*
(The vote is secret and counted in public by two volunteers.) Tj T*
(Results are published on the notice board the following day.) Tj T*
(Disputes are settled by the honorary committee within ten days.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 770 Td (MC Club Bulletin) Tj ET
