BT /F2 18 Tf 72 740 Td (Library and Rooms) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 16 TL 72 700 Td
(The library opens from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon.) Tj T*
(Books may be borrowed for two weeks and renewed once.) Tj T*
(Room B12 is reserved for chess training on Monday evenings.) Tj T*
(The main hall can be booked for events with two weeks notice.) Tj T*
(Guests must sign the visitor book at the entrance.) Tj T*
(Lost items are kept at the office for one month.) Tj T*
